{
  "id": "E122",
  "title": "Paying the Taxi",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-06-03",
  "synopsis": "Taking a taxi is convenient, even without cash.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/436/03ffeeaa233594badeded3443864a7786336598d.mp3?1496073916",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "付出租车钱\n\n乘客：师傅，就在前面的面包店门口停吧。\n师傅：好的，一共七十三块。\n乘客：哎呀，我现金不够。\n师傅：刷交通卡也可以。\n乘客：我没有交通卡，支付宝可以吗？\n师傅：也可以，您扫一下这个二维码。\n乘客：好的，钱转给您了。可以打一下发票吗？\n师傅：当然可以，给你。下车别忘了自己的东西。\n乘客：谢谢师傅。",
    "traditional": "付出租車錢\n\n乘客：師傅，就在前面的麵包店門口停吧。\n師傅：好的，一共七十三塊。\n乘客：哎呀，我現金不夠。\n師傅：刷交通卡也可以。\n乘客：我沒有交通卡，支付寶可以嗎？\n師傅：也可以，您掃一下這個二維碼。\n乘客：好的，錢轉給您了。可以打一下發票嗎？\n師傅：當然可以，給你。下車別忘了自己的東西。\n乘客：謝謝師傅。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paying the taxi"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "乘客：师傅，就在前面的面包店门口停吧。",
      "traditional": "乘客：師傅，就在前面的麵包店門口停吧。",
      "pinyin": "chéng kè shī fu jiù zài qián miàn de miàn bāo diàn mén kǒu tíng ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Passenger: Driver, please stop there outside of the bakery."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "师傅：好的，一共七十三块。",
      "traditional": "師傅：好的，一共七十三塊。",
      "pinyin": "shī fu hǎo de yí gòng qī shí sān kuài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Driver: Ok, 73 yuan in total."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "乘客：哎呀，我现金不够。",
      "traditional": "乘客：哎呀，我現金不夠。",
      "pinyin": "chéng kè āi yā wǒ xiàn jīn bú gòu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Passenger: Oh, I don’t have enough cash."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "师傅：刷交通卡也可以。",
      "traditional": "師傅：刷交通卡也可以。",
      "pinyin": "shī fu shuā jiāo tōng kǎ yě kě yǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Driver: You can also use a traffic card."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "乘客：我没有交通卡，支付宝可以吗？",
      "traditional": "乘客：我沒有交通卡，支付寶可以嗎？",
      "pinyin": "chéng kè wǒ méi yǒu jiāo tōng kǎ zhī fù bǎo kě yǐ ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Passenger: I don’t have a traffic card. Can I use Alipay?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "师傅：也可以，您扫一下这个二维码。",
      "traditional": "師傅：也可以，您掃一下這個二維碼。",
      "pinyin": "shī fu yě kě yǐ nín sǎo yí xià zhè ge èr wéi mǎ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Driver: Sure, just scan this QR code."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "乘客：好的，钱转给您了。可以打一下发票吗？",
      "traditional": "乘客：好的，錢轉給您了。可以打一下發票嗎？",
      "pinyin": "chéng kè hǎo de qián zhuàn gěi nín le kě yǐ dǎ yí xià fā piào ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Passenger: Ok, I’ve transferred the money to you. Could you give me a receipt?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "师傅：当然可以，给你。下车别忘了自己的东西。",
      "traditional": "師傅：當然可以，給你。下車別忘了自己的東西。",
      "pinyin": "shī fu dāng rán kě yǐ gěi nǐ xià chē bié wàng le zì jǐ de dōng xi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Driver: Of course, here you are. Don’t forget to take all your things."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "乘客：谢谢师傅。",
      "traditional": "乘客：謝謝師傅。",
      "pinyin": "chéng kè xiè xie shī fu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Passenger: Thanks!"
    }
  ],
